{
  "$source": {
    "repo": "acp-ui",
    "path": "fixtures/invocation-lines.json",
    "commit": "9a24596e905e0797ffdc7b97c81b0769b0397f23",
    "copied": "2026-08-30",
    "note": [
      "A COPY. acp-ui owns this file; python-acp keeps it here because the two",
      "repos are checked out independently and a test that reached across the",
      "filesystem would pass, fail or skip depending on where this repo sits.",
      "",
      "Refresh with:",
      "  cp <acp-ui>/fixtures/invocation-lines.json tests/data/invocation-lines.json",
      "then put this $source block back and update `commit` and `copied`.",
      "tests/test_invocation_lines.py fails if it is missing.",
      "",
      "A case belongs in acp-ui's copy first. Adding one only here asserts this",
      "repo against itself, which is the failure the whole file exists to prevent."
    ]
  },
  "$comment": [
    "Round-trip cases for the tool-invocation serializer, shared by two repos.",
    "",
    "acp-ui's `toInvocationLine` (src/lib/schema-form.ts) writes a command line",
    "that python-acp's `parse_command` + `coerce_arguments` (commands.py) reads.",
    "That contract crosses a language boundary, so neither side can check it",
    "alone: a serializer verified only against its own assumptions is exactly",
    "the failure this file exists to prevent.",
    "",
    "Each case is asserted twice, against the same written-down expectation.",
    "  acp-ui   : toInvocationLine(command, parseSchema(schema), values) === line",
    "  python-acp: coerce_arguments(parse_command(line), schema) == arguments",
    "",
    "`values` is in acp-ui's form representation, where text and numbers stay",
    "strings until the far end coerces them (see FormValue). `arguments` is the",
    "typed JSON the tool actually receives.",
    "",
    "Adding a case means adding it here, not in either test."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "plain scalars",
      "command": "demo/echo",
      "schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "text"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "text": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "times": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 10
          },
          "ratio": {
            "type": "number"
          }
        }
      },
      "values": {
        "text": "hello",
        "times": "7",
        "ratio": "0.5"
      },
      "line": "/demo/echo --text hello --times 7 --ratio 0.5",
      "arguments": {
        "text": "hello",
        "times": 7,
        "ratio": 0.5
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a string that has to be quoted",
      "command": "demo/echo",
      "schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "text"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "text": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "values": {
        "text": "it's a 'quote' \\ test"
      },
      "line": "/demo/echo --text 'it'\"'\"'s a '\"'\"'quote'\"'\"' \\ test'",
      "arguments": {
        "text": "it's a 'quote' \\ test"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "an empty string is sent, not omitted, when it was typed",
      "command": "demo/echo",
      "schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "prefix": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "values": {
        "prefix": " "
      },
      "line": "/demo/echo --prefix ' '",
      "arguments": {
        "prefix": " "
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "untouched optionals are omitted entirely",
      "command": "demo/echo",
      "schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "text"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "text": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "prefix": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "shout": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "kind": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "values": {
        "text": "x",
        "prefix": "",
        "shout": null,
        "kind": []
      },
      "line": "/demo/echo --text x",
      "arguments": {
        "text": "x"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "booleans are written out, never left as a bare flag",
      "command": "demo/echo",
      "schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "shout": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "quiet": {
            "type": "boolean"
          }
        }
      },
      "values": {
        "shout": true,
        "quiet": false
      },
      "line": "/demo/echo --shout true --quiet false",
      "arguments": {
        "shout": true,
        "quiet": false
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "an array is a repeated flag",
      "command": "demo/search",
      "schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "query"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "query": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "kind": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "values": {
        "query": "foo",
        "kind": [
          "file",
          "symbol",
          "two words"
        ]
      },
      "line": "/demo/search --query foo --kind file --kind symbol --kind 'two words'",
      "arguments": {
        "query": "foo",
        "kind": [
          "file",
          "symbol",
          "two words"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "an object goes as quoted JSON",
      "command": "demo/search",
      "schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "query"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "query": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "filter": {
            "type": "object"
          }
        }
      },
      "values": {
        "query": "a b",
        "filter": "{\n  \"lang\": \"ts\",\n  \"n\": 3\n}"
      },
      "line": "/demo/search --query 'a b' --filter '{\"lang\":\"ts\",\"n\":3}'",
      "arguments": {
        "query": "a b",
        "filter": {
          "lang": "ts",
          "n": 3
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "an enum choice is sent as its literal",
      "command": "demo/echo",
      "schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "case": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "upper",
              "lower",
              "title"
            ]
          },
          "level": {
            "type": "integer",
            "enum": [
              1,
              2,
              3
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "values": {
        "case": "upper",
        "level": "2"
      },
      "line": "/demo/echo --case upper --level 2",
      "arguments": {
        "case": "upper",
        "level": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "an undeclared property is read as JSON by the far end",
      "command": "demo/search",
      "schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "cursor": {},
          "tag": {}
        }
      },
      "values": {
        "cursor": "3",
        "tag": "\"3\""
      },
      "line": "/demo/search --cursor 3 --tag '\"3\"'",
      "arguments": {
        "cursor": 3,
        "tag": "3"
      }
    }
  ]
}
